{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesH4","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesH4","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.rj_canonical_inner_product","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Trace","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Notation","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Algebra.Prod"],"declarations":54,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.h4_markov_rossoJones","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.h4_markov_rossoJones","kind":"theorem","line":492,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L492-L512","doc":"**Part (iii) at `r = 4` for every Markov trace.** In any `R`-algebra `A` with\n`s₁, s₂, s₃` satisfying the Hecke, braid and far-commutation relations, any linear\nfunctional satisfying the convention-D Markov conditions has\n`[2]⁴ · t((s₁s₂s₃)ˢ) = [5] q^{3s} + [3]·qˢ·χ₄(s) + χ₂(s)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.H4.h4Trace_rossoJones_coprime","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.H4.h4Trace_rossoJones_coprime","kind":"theorem","line":479,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L479-L487","doc":"**Torus knots `τ(4, s)`, `s` odd**: the block's formula\n`[r+1] q^{s(r−1)} − [r−1] q^{s(r−3)}` at `r = 4`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.H4.h4Trace_rossoJones","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.H4.h4Trace_rossoJones","kind":"theorem","line":452,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L452-L477","doc":"**Rosso–Jones at `r = 4`, every `s`**, on the coordinate Markov trace of `H₄(q)`:\n`[2]⁴ · tr_M((σ₁σ₂σ₃)ˢ) = [5] q^{3s} + [3] · qˢ · χ₄(s) + χ₂(s)`, where\n`χ₄(s) = 3` if `4 ∣ s` else `−1` (the `(3,1)` block, on which `Δ² = γ⁴` acts by `q⁴`),\nand `χ₂(s) = 2` if `2 ∣ s` else `0` (the `(2,2)` block, on which `Δ²` acts by `1`).\nThe value is obtained by evaluating the forced coordinate trace through the concrete\nMarkov trace `RJ4.tau` (uniqueness, `markov4_unique`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.H4.qIntBal_two_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.H4.qIntBal_two_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":447,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L447-L450","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.trace_H_pow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.trace_H_pow","kind":"theorem","line":430,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L430-L437","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.trace_G_pow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.trace_G_pow","kind":"theorem","line":411,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L411-L428","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.H_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.H_sq","kind":"theorem","line":407,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L407-L409","doc":"The full twist acts on `W_{4,0}` by `1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.G_pow_four","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.G_pow_four","kind":"theorem","line":401,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L401-L405","doc":"The full twist `Δ² = γ⁴` acts on `W_{4,2}` by the scalar `q⁴`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.C121","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.C121","kind":"theorem","line":396,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L396-L399","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.B123","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.B123","kind":"theorem","line":391,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L391-L394","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.H","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.H","kind":"def","line":388,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L388-L389","doc":"`γ = σ₁σ₂σ₃` on `W_{4,0}`: the swap of the two cup diagrams. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.G","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.G","kind":"def","line":386,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L386-L387","doc":"`γ = σ₁σ₂σ₃` on `W_{4,2}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.tau_mark3_adjoin","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.tau_mark3_adjoin","kind":"theorem","line":378,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L378-L382","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.tau_mark3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.tau_mark3","kind":"theorem","line":363,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L363-L376","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.tau_mark2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.tau_mark2","kind":"theorem","line":348,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L348-L361","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.tau_cyc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.tau_cyc","kind":"theorem","line":344,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L344-L346","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.tau_S1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.tau_S1","kind":"theorem","line":332,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L332-L341","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.tau_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.tau_one","kind":"theorem","line":322,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L322-L330","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.S13_comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.S13_comm","kind":"theorem","line":309,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L309-L314","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.S23_braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Arch