asis `{(12)(34), (14)(23)}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.B3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.B3","kind":"def","line":244,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L244-L244","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.B2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.B2","kind":"def","line":243,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L243-L243","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.B1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RJ4.B1","kind":"def","line":239,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L239-L242","doc":"`σᵢ = q − eᵢ` on the 3-dimensional standard module `W_{4,2}` (shape `(3,1)`),\nbasis = position of the single cup, `eᵢ` acting by the Temperley–Lieb rules\n`eᵢ bᵢ = [2] bᵢ`, `eᵢ b_{i±1} = bᵢ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.qIntBal_five","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.qIntBal_five","kind":"theorem","line":231,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L231-L235","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.H4.markov4_unique","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.H4.markov4_unique","kind":"theorem","line":198,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L198-L223","doc":"**Markov uniqueness on `H₄`.** Any `R`-linear functional with `t 1 = 1`,\n`t s₁ = z`, `t(xy) = t(yx)`, and the Markov property at levels 2 and 3\n(`t(x s₂) = z t(x)` for `x ∈ span{1, s₁}`, `t(x s₃) = z t(x)` for `x` in the\nsubalgebra generated by `s₁, s₂`) takes the value `markovTr q z V` on `eval V`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.H3.eval_mem_adjoin","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.H3.eval_mem_adjoin","kind":"theorem","line":183,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L183-L196","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.H4.eval_gammaPow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.H4.eval_gammaPow","kind":"theorem","line":171,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L171-L180","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.H4.eval_rs3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.H4.eval_rs3","kind":"theorem","line":147,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L147-L168","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.H4.eval_rs2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.H4.eval_rs2","kind":"theorem","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L123-L145","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.H4.eval_rs1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.H4.eval_rs1","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesH4.lean#L107-L121","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.H4.eval","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.H4.eval","kind":"def","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://githu